{"id":"6bf45d8047f2ba42","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-diamond-confluence.md","title":"菱形性质蕴含合流","display":"thm-diamond-confluence — 菱形性质蕴含合流","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"theorem","label":"56-thm-diamond-confluence","aliases":["56-thm-diamond-confluence"],"display":"thm-diamond-confluence — 菱形性质蕴含合流","depends_on":["[[56-df-diamond-property]]","[[56-df-confluent]]","[[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]"],"source_section":"§1.1 Proposition 1.1.11","source_printed_pages":"12","source_ocr_blocks":[33],"source_verification":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-diamond-confluence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-diamond-confluence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-diamond-confluence — 菱形性质蕴含合流"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65c58dd574cd435d\" href=\"?note=65c58dd574cd435d\" title=\"56-df-diamond-property\">56-df-diamond-property</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c74959a8cb14eaa5\" href=\"?note=c74959a8cb14eaa5\" title=\"56-df-confluent\">56-df-confluent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"89129816153530db\" href=\"?note=89129816153530db\" title=\"56-df-abstract-reduction-system\">56-df-abstract-reduction-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.1 Proposition 1.1.11"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"12"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>33</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\\subseteq A\\times A\">\\(\\to\\subseteq A\\times A\\)</span>；单关系抽象归约系统见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"89129816153530db\" href=\"?note=89129816153530db\" title=\"56-df-abstract-reduction-system\">56-df-abstract-reduction-system</a>。</li>\n<li>菱形性质与合流见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65c58dd574cd435d\" href=\"?note=65c58dd574cd435d\" title=\"56-df-diamond-property\">56-df-diamond-property</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c74959a8cb14eaa5\" href=\"?note=c74959a8cb14eaa5\" title=\"56-df-confluent\">56-df-confluent</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Diamond}(A,\\to)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Confluent}(A,\\to).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Diamond}(A,\\to)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Confluent}(A,\\to).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书命题取辅助关系为原关系的特例。局部推导已复核：在两个有限归约边界上逐格应用一步菱形，有限矩形填充产生共同后继。一般局部合流底边可为任意长度，不能用同一有限网格论证。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-diamond-property","status":"resolved","id":"65c58dd574cd435d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-diamond-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-confluent","status":"resolved","id":"c74959a8cb14eaa5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-confluent]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"89129816153530db","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excer